{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "、" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ヒント」は取れる2枚を1組光らせます。「並べ替え」は残りをそこから取り切れる配置に組み直します（戻せる1手は無くなります）。「戻す」は直前に取った2枚を盤に返します。1局に%1$lld回まで無料で、使い切ったら広告を見ると%2$lld回補充できます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Hint\" highlights one pair you can take. \"Shuffle\" rearranges the remaining tiles so they can be cleared (you can't undo the move before it). \"Undo\" puts the last 2 tiles you took back on the board. You get %1$lld free per game, and can watch an ad for %2$lld more once they're used up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」を補充できませんでした" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't Add Undos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのほかの牌" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Other tiles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どのかたちも144枚で、必ず取り切れるように配ります。最短タイムはかたちごとに別々に記録されます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every layout uses 144 tiles and is always dealt so it can be cleared. Best times are recorded separately for each layout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめるときと「新規ゲーム」を押したときに、盤面のかたちを選べます。亀甲・ピラミッド・十字の3種類があり、どれも144枚で必ずクリアできます。最短タイムはかたちごとに別々に記録されます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can pick a layout when you start and whenever you tap \"New Game\". There are 3 layouts (Turtle, Pyramid and Cross), each with 144 tiles and always clearable. Best times are recorded separately for each layout"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "クリア！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cleared!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
