    "同じ牌を 2 枚タップ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap 2 matching tiles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌を2枚ずつ取って全部消そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match pairs of tiles to clear the board"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "季節牌" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seasons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を最後まで視聴すると「戻す」を%lld回ぶん補充します。\n盤面はそのままです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the whole ad to get %lld more undo.\nYour board stays as it is."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the whole ad to get %lld more undos.\nYour board stays as it is."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て%lld回補充する" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad for %lld More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに新しい盤面が配られたか、光らせられる組が無くなりました。組が無いときは「並べ替え」で残りを配置し直してください。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new board was dealt while the ad was playing, or there's no pair left to highlight. If there are no pairs, use \"Shuffle\" to rearrange the remaining tiles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに新しい盤面が配られたか、残った牌が重なっていて取り切れません。取り切れないときは「はじめから」で新しい盤面を配ってください。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new board was dealt while the ad was playing, or the remaining tiles are stacked so they can't all be cleared. If they can't be cleared, tap \"Restart\" for a new board."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに配り直されたか、局が終わったため、補充できませんでした。\n新しい盤面の「戻す」は無料の回数まで戻っています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The tiles were redealt or the game ended while the ad was playing, so no undos were added.\nThe new board starts with the free undos again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見てヒントを見る" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad for a Hint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て並べ替える" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad to Shuffle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ると取れる組が1組光ります" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to highlight one pair you can take"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ると残りが並べ替わり、そこから必ず取り切れる配置になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to rearrange the remaining tiles so they can always be cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を視聴すると、いま取れる組を1組だけ光らせます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to highlight one pair you can take right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を視聴すると、残りの牌をそこから必ず取り切れる配置に並べ替えます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to rearrange the remaining tiles so they can always be cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
