    },
    "直前の1手を戻す（残り%lld）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Undo Last Move (%lld left)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "積まれた牌を" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove the stack"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端は取れる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ends are free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flowers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌と季節牌" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flowers and seasons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌・季節牌以外は、まったく同じ絵柄の2枚だけが合います。一萬と二萬のように種類が同じでも数が違えば合いません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All other tiles only match an identical tile. For example, 1 of Characters and 2 of Characters are the same suit but don't match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌（梅・蘭・菊・竹）どうし、季節牌（春・夏・秋・冬）どうしは、絵柄が違っても合わせて取れます。梅と蘭、春と冬のような組み合わせで消えるのはこのためです" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any two flower tiles (plum, orchid, chrysanthemum, bamboo) match each other even if the pictures differ, and so do any two season tiles (spring, summer, autumn, winter). That's why pairs like plum and orchid, or spring and winter, disappear together"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "途中で終了すると今の盤面が失われます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you quit now, your current board will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選択中" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "selected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
